            "help_uri": "https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/2847/oj/eng"
          }
        ],
        "remediation": "Give every element its own well-formed identifier, the one dependency relationships refer to. CycloneDX: set a bom-ref on every component, one that differs from the component's name.",
